      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. regarding the \"unexpected events\" you mentioned—how much buffer should i actually add to account for those? like, if my supplier in shenzhen usually takes 14 days but sometimes it takes 21, how do i factor that variability into the safety stock math specifically?",
